 <div class="container-fluid"> <div class="row"> <div class="container"> <div class="col-md-5 col-sm-12 col-xs-12"> <div class="image-section"> <span class="image_hover"> <img src="images/bharat/Gallery/ferro/FerroSiliconManganese.png" alt="Avatar" class="imagee zoom_img_effect img-responsive"> </span> </div></div><div class="col-md-7 col-sm-12 col-xs-12"> <div class="text-section"> <h3 class="tsh">Ferro Silicon Manganese</h3> <p class="tsp">We provide our clients excellent quality Ferro Silicon Manganese which is an alloy of manganese and silicon. This alloy is used as an oxidizing agent in steel and iron plants. The combined properties of both the metals provide steel increased strength, ductility, rigidity and high resistance. Clients can avail the following grades at industry leading prices. We also undertake orders to supply grades customized to meet the buyers' requirements.</p><div class="table-res"> <table class="table customerr"> <thead> <tr> <th>Manganese</th> <th>Silicon</th> <th>Carbon</th> <th>Sulphur</th> <th>Phosphorus</th> </tr></thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>50-55%</td><td>12-14%</td><td>2.50% max</td><td>0.04% max</td><td>0.40% max</td></tr><tr> <td>60-65%</td><td>14-17%</td><td>2.50% max</td><td>0.03% max</td><td>0.35% max</td></tr><tr> <td>65-70%</td><td>15-18%</td><td>2.00%</td><td>0.03% max</td><td>0.30% max</td></tr></tbody> </table> </div></div></div></div></div></div></section> <section class="pad45-top-bottom"> <div class="container-fluid"> <div class="row"> <div class="container"> <div class="col-md-5 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 pull-right"> <div class="image-section"> <span class="image_hover "> <img src="images/bharat/Gallery/ferro/FerroSilicon.png" alt="Avatar" class="imagee zoom_img_effect img-responsive"> </span> </div></div><div class="col-md-7 col-sm-12 col-xs-12"> <div class="text-section "> <h3 class="tsh">Ferro Silicon</h3> <p class="tsp">Ferro Silicon is used as a source of silicon to reduce metals from their oxides and to deoxidize steel and other ferrous alloys. It prevents the loss of carbon from the molten steel , and can be used to make other ferroalloys. Ferrosilicon is also used for manufacture of silicon, corrosion-resistant and high-temperature resistant ferrous silicon alloys, and silicon steel for electromotors and transformer cores. In the manufacture of cast iron, ferrosilicon is used for inoculation of the iron to accelerate graphitization.</p><p class="tsp">We offer this ferro alloy at extremely competitive rates, with grade, packaging and grain size as per customer's requirement.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section> <?php include_once('footer.php'); ?>  <script src="js/jquery.min.js"></script> <script src="js/bootstrap.min.js"></script> <script src="js/custom.js"></script> <script src="js/theme.js"></script> </body></html>